[N 33-35 Booty Bay and the Drowned City]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\Booty Bay (inn, Expert Fishing, Baron Revilgaz's optional Stone of the Tides chain on the haunted isle) and the Drowned City, the sunken troll city off the Stranglethorn coast: Dibbs' tablets and fetishes, Krazek's Saltseer pirates and Timear's idol in one run, then the hand-ins in Booty Bay, Southshore, the Dalaran crater and Ironforge.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel 34|r  -  this chapter wants level 34: Krazek's two Saltseer quests and Timear's idol need it, and the Drowned City quests are level 40 (mob levels inside are not in the data; the Brinescale naga on the coast outside are 36-38). You arrive at about 33. At 33, do the optional Stone of the Tides block first (two quests of 2,850 XP plus ~17 elemental kills) and take Krazek's quests when you come back; if you skip that block and are still under 34, run the dungeon for Dibbs' quests anyway and leave Krazek's two untaken.
[OC]|cffffcc00Carried in:|r Talk of the Town (98463, Barkeep Kelly, chapter 27) hands in here; An Acquaintance in Southshore (95786, chapter 30) goes to Dibbs after the run; Take Two With Water (95787) and Magics of the Drowned City (95788) from Dibbs in chapter 27 are the run, with The Web of Magic (95798) if he gave it to you then. A Fine Mess (2904) only if you kept it from Gnomeregan. Hearth = Southshore until the inn below; the Booty Bay flight point is known (chapter 30).
[OC]|cffffcc00Faldir's Cove:|r the cove quests (663-669, level 35) are done in chapter 39 on the Arathi visit, with 670 and 667.
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Training:|r no shaman trainer here; the chapter ends in Ironforge at Eldrun (the level 34 row, and the 36 row if you are 36).

[OC]|cffffffffBooty Bay|r  -  the inn, Talk of the Town, the Expert Fishing book and Krazek all stand within a few units of the inn (27.0,77.3)
At [TAR6807 Innkeeper Skindle], bind your Hearthstone to [S Booty Bay] (the Southshore bind from chapter 27 ends here; chapter 32 binds Theramore) [G27.0,77.3 Stranglethorn Vale]
At [TAR2832 Nixxrax Fillamug] in the Salty Sailor Tavern, [QT98463] (265 XP) [G27.0,77.2 Stranglethorn Vale]
At [TAR2626 Old Man Heming], [V] buy Expert Fishing - The Bass and You (1g) (needs Fishing 125 and level 20) and read it at once: Fishing cap 225 [G27.4,77.2 Stranglethorn Vale]
[O]At [TAR2664 Kelsey Yance], [V] Recipe: Rockscale Cod (22s) (Cooking 175, +12 Fishing food: skill filler for the coast fish) and, if gold allows, Recipe: Cooked Glossy Mightfish (1g 60s) (Cooking 225, +30 attack power, eaten from level 35: the next step up after Mithril Head Trout - learn it at 225) [G28.2,74.3 Stranglethorn Vale]
[O]At [TAR7853 Scooty], [QT2904] (2,450 XP - only if you kept A Fine Mess from chapter 24) [G27.6,77.5 Stranglethorn Vale]
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Gear (2904):|r vendor all three: Fairywing Mantle (cloth +1 Sta +6 Int) loses to the Palm Frond Mantle from chapter 30, Technician's Bracers (leather +4 Str +4 Sta +4 Int) to the Arathi Armbands, and Fire-welded Bracers are mail
[O]|cffffcc00Fish to 150:|r with the Expert book read, fish the Booty Bay harbour toward 150 (cap 225) whenever you wait on something here [SK Fishing 150] [G27.4,77.2 Stranglethorn Vale]

[OC]|cffffffffStone of the Tides (optional)|r  -  Baron Revilgaz's chain: two round trips to the haunted isle up the west coast (20.8,23.2, about 54 map units north of town), a bracer collection there, a trip to Dalaran, then Duncan's blade; the last step (Gazban) is on the way to the dungeon. 14,185 XP in all and the Robe of Crystal Waters. Skip the whole block if you are 34 and want the dungeon now
[O]At [TAR773 Krazek], [QA616 The Haunted Isle] (285 XP) [G26.9,77.2 Stranglethorn Vale]
[O]At [TAR2496 Baron Revilgaz], [QT616] [QA578 The Stone of the Tides] (2,850 XP: find the haunted island) [G27.2,76.9 Stranglethorn Vale]
[OC]Lesser Water Elementals (level 36-37, 24 spawns) cover the isle. Gazban (level 40) and the Altar of the Tides at 25.0,23.6 are for the last quest of the chain: leave them for now. Brinescale Skirmishers (36-38) walk the coast. The Drowned City cave is close by, at about 21.4,27.9
[O]Head north up the west coast to the haunted isle and explore it [QC578] [G20.8,23.2 Stranglethorn Vale]
[O]At [TAR2496 Baron Revilgaz], [QT578] (2,850 XP + 40s) [QA601 Water Elementals] (6 Water Elemental Bracers from the isle's elementals) [G27.2,76.9 Stranglethorn Vale]
[O]Kill [TAR691 Lesser Water Elemental] on the haunted isle for 6 Water Elemental Bracers [QC601] (~36% - budget ~17 kills) [G20.9,23.3 Stranglethorn Vale]
[O]Not 6 bracers after ~17 kills: abandon Water Elementals, and the rest of the chain with it [QS601] [G20.9,23.3 Stranglethorn Vale]
[O]At [TAR2496 Baron Revilgaz], [QT601] (2,850 XP + 40s) [QA602 Magical Analysis] (1,400 XP: the Bag of Water Elemental Bracers goes to Archmage Ansirem in Dalaran) [G27.2,76.9 Stranglethorn Vale]

[OC]|cffffffffDalaran (optional, only with Magical Analysis)|r  -  a flight to Southshore, the ride to the Dalaran crater in the Alterac Mountains, then the hearth back to Booty Bay. It is also the only pass by Archmage Timear before the run
[O]At [TAR2859 Gyll], |cFFfff8a3Fly to [F Southshore]|r (the game routes it) [G27.5,77.8 Stranglethorn Vale]
[O]Ride from Southshore to the Dalaran crater. At [TAR2543 Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver], [QT602] (1,400 XP) [QA603 Ansirem's Key] (1,400 XP: back to Catelyn in Booty Bay) [G18.8,78.5 Alterac Mountains]
[O]At [TAR31439 Archmage Timear], [QA97130 Ancient Gurubashi Secrets] (3,900 XP, needs level 34: an Ancient Gurubashi Idol from the Drowned City; the data does not say what gives it) [G16.2,71.7 Alterac Mountains]
[O]|cFFfff8a3Hearth to [H Booty Bay]|r [G16.2,71.7 Alterac Mountains]

[OC]|cffffffffBack in Booty Bay|r  -  Krazek's quests (level 34), then Catelyn and Duncan if you are on the Stone of the Tides chain
At [TAR773 Krazek], [QA95791 The Saltseer Captain] (3,900 XP, needs level 34: 3 Saltseer Coroners and Captain Dreadrise in the Drowned City, |cff66ff66normal|r; still under 34, leave it and Shady Saltseers untaken) [G26.9,77.2 Stranglethorn Vale]
[O]At [TAR773 Krazek], [QA95789 Shady Saltseers] (3,900 XP, needs level 34: 10 Voodoo-Infused Artifacts from the Saltseer pirates inside, |cffffcc00grind|r) [G26.9,77.2 Stranglethorn Vale]
[O]At [TAR2542 Catelyn the Blade], [QT603] (1,400 XP) [QA610 "Pretty Boy" Duncan] (2,250 XP: her blade back from Duncan) [G27.3,77.5 Stranglethorn Vale]
